{
 "id": "seg2",
 "title": "刷卡写字楼",
 "pill": 2,
 "total": 94.64,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg2-00",
   "text": "先给一句准确的说法。",
   "spoken": "先给一句准确的说法。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg2-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 1.76,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 3.148
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-01",
   "text": "许可链，只让获得授权的参与者，读写或出块。",
   "spoken": "许可链，只让获得授权的参与者，读写或出块。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg2-01.wav",
   "start": 3.58,
   "dur": 4.4,
   "speechStart": 3.58,
   "speechEnd": 7.803
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-02",
   "text": "由多家组织共同治理的许可链，叫联盟链。",
   "spoken": "由多家组织共同治理的许可链，叫联盟链。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg2-02.wav",
   "start": 8.2,
   "dur": 4.0,
   "speechStart": 8.2,
   "speechEnd": 11.969
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-03",
   "text": "它把谁能参与，从密码学和经济的问题，变成了身份和治理的问题。",
   "spoken": "它把谁能参与，从密码学和经济的问题，变成了身份和治理的问题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg2-03.wav",
   "start": 12.42,
   "dur": 6.08,
   "speechStart": 12.42,
   "speechEnd": 18.34
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-04",
   "text": "攻击者不再需要多数算力。",
   "spoken": "攻击者不再需要多数算力。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg2-04.wav",
   "start": 18.72,
   "dur": 2.32,
   "speechStart": 18.72,
   "speechEnd": 20.81
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-05",
   "text": "一张有效证书，一把管理员密钥，或者几家成员共谋，就够了。",
   "spoken": "一张有效证书，一把管理员密钥，或者几家成员共谋，就够了。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg2-05.wav",
   "start": 21.26,
   "dur": 5.6,
   "speechStart": 21.35,
   "speechEnd": 26.694
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-06",
   "text": "打个比方，公链像公共广场，谁都能进，靠规则和押金维持秩序。",
   "spoken": "打个比方，公链像公共广场，谁都能进，靠规则和押金维持秩序。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg2-06.wav",
   "start": 27.08,
   "dur": 6.08,
   "speechStart": 27.176,
   "speechEnd": 32.997
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-07",
   "text": "许可链像一栋写字楼，进门要刷工牌。",
   "spoken": "许可链像一栋写字楼，进门要刷工牌。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg2-07.wav",
   "start": 33.38,
   "dur": 3.6,
   "speechStart": 33.38,
   "speechEnd": 36.825
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-08",
   "text": "陌生人大多进不来，可发工牌的前台，拿着万能钥匙的物业，成了最值得攻击的人。",
   "spoken": "陌生人大多进不来，可发工牌的前台，拿着万能钥匙的物业，成了最值得攻击的人。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg2-08.wav",
   "start": 37.2,
   "dur": 7.44,
   "speechStart": 37.294,
   "speechEnd": 44.446
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-09",
   "text": "这个比方有一处不成立。",
   "spoken": "这个比方有一处不成立。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg2-09.wav",
   "start": 44.86,
   "dur": 1.92,
   "speechStart": 44.953,
   "speechEnd": 46.569
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-10",
   "text": "写字楼失窃，可以调监控，可以报警。",
   "spoken": "写字楼失窃，可以掉监控，可以报警。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg2-10.wav",
   "start": 47.0,
   "dur": 3.68,
   "speechStart": 47.0,
   "speechEnd": 50.478
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-11",
   "text": "联盟链里，多数成员可以合法地重写业务状态。",
   "spoken": "联盟链里，多数成员可以合法的虫写业务状态。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg2-11.wav",
   "start": 50.9,
   "dur": 4.16,
   "speechStart": 50.999,
   "speechEnd": 54.893
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-12",
   "text": "账本本身，看不出这是作恶。",
   "spoken": "账本本身，看不出这是作恶。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg2-12.wav",
   "start": 55.28,
   "dur": 2.48,
   "speechStart": 55.378,
   "speechEnd": 57.515
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-13",
   "text": "按攻击者控制的资源，排一排入口。",
   "spoken": "按攻击者控制的资源，排一排入口。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg2-13.wav",
   "start": 57.98,
   "dur": 2.64,
   "speechStart": 57.98,
   "speechEnd": 60.432
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-14",
   "text": "一张普通成员证书，能读通道数据，发送畸形请求。",
   "spoken": "一张普通成员证书，能读通道数据，发送畸形请求。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg2-14.wav",
   "start": 60.84,
   "dur": 4.64,
   "speechStart": 60.932,
   "speechEnd": 65.284
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-15",
   "text": "组织管理员的证书，能改本组织的配置，批准链码。",
   "spoken": "组织管理员的证书，能改本组织的配置，批准链码。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg2-15.wav",
   "start": 65.7,
   "dur": 4.24,
   "speechStart": 65.793,
   "speechEnd": 69.735
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-16",
   "text": "根 CA 的私钥，能签发任意身份。",
   "spoken": "根 CA 的私钥，能签发任意身份。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg2-16.wav",
   "start": 70.16,
   "dur": 3.44,
   "speechStart": 70.259,
   "speechEnd": 73.405
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-17",
   "text": "足够多的背书组织，能写入符合策略的任意状态。",
   "spoken": "足够多的背书组织，能写入符合策略的任意状态。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg2-17.wav",
   "start": 73.82,
   "dur": 4.88,
   "speechStart": 73.82,
   "speechEnd": 78.503
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-18",
   "text": "所以不要把成员都是持牌机构，当成安全假设。",
   "spoken": "所以不要把成员都是持牌机构，荡成安全假设。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg2-18.wav",
   "start": 78.92,
   "dur": 4.24,
   "speechStart": 79.011,
   "speechEnd": 82.916
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-19",
   "text": "Ronin 桥有 9 个验证者，5 个签名就能放行，攻击者控制了验证者，提走了资金。",
   "spoken": "Ronin 桥有 9 个验证者，5 个签名就能放行，攻击者控制了验证者，提走了资金。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg2-19.wav",
   "start": 83.38,
   "dur": 6.64,
   "speechStart": 83.476,
   "speechEnd": 89.779
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-20",
   "text": "许可的集合小，攻破的门槛也低。",
   "spoken": "许可的集合小，攻破的门槛也低。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg2-20.wav",
   "start": 90.24,
   "dur": 3.2,
   "speechStart": 90.24,
   "speechEnd": 93.253
  }
